EL祁康安：少侠且等一会，很快便好。NOR"}}},caozuoName2="交谈",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"YEL祁康安：少侠有什么问题也可问问蛇母。NOR"}}},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"39004",3}}}},autoResult1={{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={},autoCondition7={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult7={}},rwnpc03={id="rwnpc03",baseId="rwnpc10",combatid={1,1001},name="蛇母",teamMark=-1,canSee=1,caozuoName1="交谈",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"CYN她看了你一眼，没有说话。NOR"}}},caozuoName2="查看",buttonShow2=1,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="gaintab",args={"39004",3}},{type="doc",args={"CYN她戴着蛇形的面具，拿着一捧柚子叶随着乐声起舞，乐声、舞姿诡奇又庄肃。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN你在不知不觉中入定了，直到祁康安唤了你几声，你才回过神来，只觉得神清气爽。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN两侧的乐师不知何时离去了，蛇母也端在主位上，好似从未起来过。NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,0}},{type="showbutton",args={3,1}},{type="refresh",args={}}},caozuoName3="交谈",buttonShow3=0,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={{type="gaintab",args={"39004",4}},{type="doc",args={"YEL蛇母：少侠所求之物……远在天边，近在眼前。NOR"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL蛇母：有些少侠认为已然离开之物，或许依然在原地等你。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN一语毕，蛇母捂嘴咳了一阵，祁康安意味不明地笑了笑。NOR"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL祁康安：看来蛇母祈福消耗过多，我先带她下去休息，少侠就请自便吧。NOR"}},{type="outobject",args={"rwnpc02"}},{type="outobject",args={"rwnpc03"}}},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={},autoCondition7={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult7={}},rwnpc04={id="rwnpc04",baseId="rwnpc10",combatid={1,1001},name="蛇母",teamMark=-1,canSee=1,caozuoName1="交谈",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"YEL蛇母：我受人监视，不便久待，只能与少侠长话短说。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL蛇母：少侠要找的孩子还在村里，正深受折磨，少侠若想救她，我可告知少侠地点。但我也有所求，一是助我杀了祈康安和他的伥鬼们！二是……我的亲妹妹在祈康安手中，你帮我找到她，救出她。NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}},{type="showbutton",args={3,1}}},caozuoName2="交谈",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="redoc",args={"YEL蛇母：少侠若是想投诚祁康安，大可将与我的谈话内容告知他。若是不想掺这浑水，也可等到洪水退去，直接离开，只不过千万别吃灵蛇丹。NOR","YEL蛇母：我瞧少侠与以往来的人都不同，我私心期望少侠能助我。NOR"}}},caozuoName3="同意",buttonShow3=0,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={{type="gaintab",args={"39004",11}},{type="gaintab",args={"39008",1}},{type="doc",args={"CYN你答应了她的要求，但她却并无激动，她的眼眶红了，咬着唇不语，片刻后才哑着声音继续说。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL蛇母：……我知这对少侠并不公平，若是少侠想要反悔，随时……都可。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL蛇母：少侠应当知道柳树左边的那些院子，祁康安说那边闹鬼，从不许人接近，因为他就将敛来的财宝和抓来的孩子藏在那边。从左数的第一间院子，少侠要找的孩子就关在那。少侠明日大可前去探查一番，而后再来与我计划后边的事。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="outgame",args={"hdrole0904"}},{type="showbutton",args={2,0}},{type="showbutton",args={3,0}},{type="showbutton",args={4,1}},{type="refresh",args={}}},caozuoName4="交谈",buttonShow4=0,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={{type="redoc",args={"YEL蛇母：我本名苏红梅，少侠别再唤我蛇母了，那只是一个用来控制人心的傀儡罢了。NOR","YEL蛇母：少侠若是要去探查，最好白天去，晚上祁康安会在那边看守。白天他作为村长不能消失太久，更何况后天便是灵蛇祭，他需要在村内主导。NOR","YEL蛇母：只怕是恶鬼也难杀恶人，若不然祁康安早就该被挫骨扬灰。NOR"}}},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={},autoCondition7={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult7={}},bsnpc01={id="bsnpc01",baseId="bsnpc02",combatid={1,1001},name="疯老头",teamMark=-1,canSee=1,caozuoName1="交谈",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="redoc",args={"YEL疯老头：你觉着是人可信还是鬼可信？或者蛇更可信……哈哈哈哈哈哈……NOR","YEL脏老头：灵丹妙药助长生啊，谁信谁吃谁难离，化作伥鬼同生死……NOR"}}},buttonShow2=1,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}